    "text": "<p>Among</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>16</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
